   "STANDARD EQUIPMENT                                                          OPTIONAL EQUIPMENT": "720 mm chassis width smaller than a pallet                                  Drive wheels: heavy duty, high grip\nLong tiller with a low mounting point                                       Load wheels: tandem polyurethane or single / tandem polyurethane\nPower assisted steering with variable steering resistance                   greasable load wheels\n\nAutomatic speed reduction when cornering                                    Alternative fork dimensions\n\n1.5 kW AC motor (maintenance free)                                          Load backrest 1800 mm / 1200 mm\n\nVertical 3 PzS battery compartment                                          Low speed option when initial lift is lowered\n\nElectromagnetic emergency brake acting proportionally to the load weight    Lift end stop sensor\n\nKey switch or Log in PIN code (no extra)                                    Accessory support\n\nWork station with storage compartments                                      Support data terminal incl. power supply cable 24 V\n\nCAN bus technology                                                          Support clipboard DIN A4\n                                                                            Support for scanner\nMultifunction coloured display of the hour meter, maintenance indication,\nbattery discharge indicator and internal fault code indication              Lateral 3 PzS battery compartment\nHeavy duty drive wheel                                                      Lateral 4 PzS battery compartment\nPolyurethane single load wheels                                             Battery stand – fixed and mobile\nProtection: -10 °C                                                          Cold store protection: - 35 °C\n                                                                            Working lamp LED front\n                                                         